  "body": "Experience the best of North Shore living in this beautifully crafted brand-new duplex Townhouse, positioned in the heart of sought-after Rothesay Bay. Designed with effortless living in mind, this elegant two-level home combines quality finishes, thoughtful design, and a sun-soaked aspect just moments from the beach.\r\n\r\nEnjoy an easy stroll to golden sands, sparkling ocean views, vibrant cafés, and everyday conveniences — all while being securely positioned within the prestigious Rangitoto College zone.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n• Freehold title – no body corporate, no society fees\r\n• Light-filled north–south orientation\r\n• Generous open-plan living and dining flowing seamlessly to a panoramic balcony\r\n• 3 spacious bedrooms including a private master suite\r\n• Dedicated study – ideal for working from home\r\n• 2 stylish bathrooms plus a separate guest toilet\r\n• Internal access garage, EV charger ready\r\n\r\nPremium Features & Finishes:\r\n\r\n• Full Fisher & Paykel kitchen suite – oven, cooktop & dishwasher\r\n• Designer bathrooms with smart toilets and underfloor heating\r\n• Belgian Quick-Step flooring (warrantied quality and style)\r\n• Luxurious NZ-made Godfrey Hirst 50oz 100% nylon carpet\r\n• Durable Vitex weather-resistant decking\r\n• Clever under-stair built-in shoe storage\r\n\r\nEducation Excellence:\r\nZoned for Browns Bay School, Murrays Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Northcross\r\nIntermediate, and Rangitoto College — a rare opportunity in one of Auckland’s most\r\ndesirable academic zones.\r\n\r\nTitles issued. CCC granted. Move in immediately.\r\n\r\nSecure your place in the Rothesay Bay lifestyle — where coastal charm meets modern\r\nelegance. Contact us today to arrange your private viewing.",
